SUMMARY:Diana Ross: Diana in Motion
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $159 $189 $229 $269 \nFrom her groundbreaking role as the lead singer of The Supremes to her extraordinary solo career\, Diana Ross has shaped the sound of popular music for generations. As part of Motown’s most successful group\, she helped define an era with timeless hits like “Stop! In the Name of Love\,” “You Can’t Hurry Love\,” and “Baby Love.” Her solo career soared with classics including “Ain’t No Mountain High Enough\,” “Endless Love\,” “I’m Coming Out\,” and “Upside Down.” \nA global superstar\, Ross’s influence extends far beyond music. She is a Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award recipient\, a Presidential Medal of Freedom honoree\, and a member of the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame with The Supremes. Her artistry\, elegance\, and enduring presence have made her one of the most celebrated performers of all time. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
