SUMMARY:Radio Soul! The Early Songs of Elvis Costello - Elvis Costello & The Imposters with Charlie Sexton
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $89 $99 $129 $149\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, June 3 at 9:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, June 5 at 10:00 a.m. \nCLICK HERE FOR ARTIST PRESALE \nFor over four decades\, Elvis Costello has remained one of music’s most fearless and influential songwriters — blending rock\, punk\, new wave\, soul\, and pop into a catalog of songs that continue to inspire generations. Now\, Costello returns to the stage with The Imposters and special guest Charlie Sexton for Radio Soul!: The Early Songs of Elvis Costello. \nThis unforgettable live performance celebrates the groundbreaking early years of Costello’s career\, featuring songs drawn from his first eleven albums — from My Aim Is True through Blood & Chocolate — including fan favorites\, deep cuts\, and the sharp lyrical storytelling that helped define an era. \nBacked by the powerhouse musicianship of The Imposters and the electrifying guitar work of Charlie Sexton\, the evening promises a high-energy journey through some of Costello’s most iconic songs\, blending raw rock & roll spirit with soulful melodies and biting wit. \nDon’t miss this rare opportunity to experience one of music’s most celebrated songwriters performing the songs that helped shape modern rock music — live on stage. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/elvis-costello-the-imposters-with-charlie-sexton/
