SUMMARY:The Billy Joel Legacy
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $39 $49 $59 $69\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, June 10 at 10:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, June 12 at 10:00 a.m. \nClick Here to purchase VIP Experience \nThe Billy Joel Legacy VIP Experience Upgrade* $100\n\nA private 20-minute acoustic performance with the lead performer of The Billy Joel Legacy for VIP attendees only\, featuring exclusive Billy Joel songs not performed in the main show.\n\nA Meet & Greet and photo opportunity with the lead performer of The Billy Joel Legacy show.\n\nA limited edition\, collectible VIP laminate & lanyard\n\n*Upgrade packages DO NOT INCLUDE TICKETS. A ticket is required to enter the venue.\nExperience the music\, story\, and legacy of one of America’s most beloved singer-songwriters with The Billy Joel Legacy: Celebrating the Piano Man. From the producers of The Simon and Garfunkel Story and The Life and Music of George Michael\, this captivating concert event takes audiences on a journey through Billy Joel’s remarkable career—from his Long Island beginnings to international superstardom. Featuring faithful recreations of his greatest hits\, stunning multimedia visuals\, and engaging storytelling\, The Billy Joel Legacy brings classics like “Piano Man\,” “Uptown Girl\,” “We Didn’t Start the Fire\,” “New York State of Mind\,” and more to life on stage. Discover the stories behind the songs\, the moments that shaped the music\, and the enduring impact of an artist whose work continues to inspire generations. More than a tribute concert\, this is a heartfelt celebration of Billy Joel’s extraordinary contribution to music and culture. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/the-billy-joel-legacy/
