SUMMARY:Diamond Rio
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $39 $49 $59 $69 \nCountry music trailblazers Diamond Rio have been delivering chart-topping hits and signature harmonies for decades. Formed in the late 1980s\, the band made history with their debut single “Meet in the Middle\,” becoming the first country group ever to reach No. 1 with a debut release. They quickly followed with a string of hits\, including “How Your Love Makes Me Feel\,” “One More Day\,” “Beautiful Mess\,” “Unbelievable\,” and “I Believe\,” earning a reputation for their rich vocals and exceptional musicianship. \nWith more than 6.8 million albums sold\, over a billion global streams\, and an impressive run of 20 Top 10 singles\, Diamond Rio has remained a constant force in country music. Known for playing every note on their recordings\, the band’s artistry extends beyond radio hits to acclaimed instrumental performances and genre-spanning projects\, including their Grammy Award-winning Christian album\, The Reason. \nA member of the Grand Ole Opry and recipient of multiple CMA\, ACM\, and Grammy honors\, Diamond Rio continues to captivate audiences with their timeless sound and energetic live performances. Don’t miss your chance to experience one of country music’s most celebrated groups live in concert. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/diamond-rio-2026/
